content.text:
### Result
"* { box-sizing: border-box; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
body { font: 16px / 1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; color: rgb(29, 35, 48); background: rgb(247, 247, 249); }
header.site { background: rgb(36, 59, 107); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 12px 24px; display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; }
header.site .brand { font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; }
main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0px 24px; }
.card { background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(221, 225, 234); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
button, .btn { font: inherit; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgb(36, 59, 107); background: rgb(36, 59, 107); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); cursor: pointer; }
button.secondary { background: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(36, 59, 107); }
input, select, textarea { font: inherit; padding: 6px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(184, 191, 204); border-radius: 4px; }
label { display: block; margin: 10px 0px 4px; font-weight: 600; }
.muted { color: rgb(102, 112, 133); }
.result { margin-top: 12px; padding: 12px; background: rgb(238, 246, 238); border: 1px solid rgb(156, 199, 156); border-radius: 6px; }
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
th, td { border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(227, 230, 238); padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  main { padding: 0px 8px; }
  .promo-strip { min-width: 620px; background: rgb(238, 242, 251); }
  .policy-note { white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: clip; }
}
----

<header class="site"><span class="brand">Acme Outdoor</span><span class="muted" style="color:#c9d3ea">Test site</span></header><main><h1>Store policies</h1><section class="card"><h2>Section A</h2><p>Free returns within 60 days on all orders shipped to the continental United States and Canada.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Section B</h2><div class="promo-strip">Free returns within 60 days on all orders shipped to the continental United States and Canada.</div></section><section class="card"><h2>Section C</h2><div class="promo-strip">Free returns within 60 days on all orders shipped to the continental United States and Canada.</div></section><section class="card"><h2>Section D</h2><p>Free returns within 60 days on all orders shipped to the continental United States and Canada.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Section E</h2><p>Free returns within 60 days on all orders shipped to the continental United States and Canada.</p></section><section class="card"><h2>Section F</h2><p class="policy-note">Free returns within 60 days on all orders shipped to the continental United States and Canada.</p></section></main>


"
### Ran Playwright code
```js
await page.evaluate('() => [...document.styleSheets].map(s=>{try{return [...s.cssRules].map(r=>r.cssText).join('\n')}catch(e){return s.href}}).join('\n') + '\n----\n' + document.body.innerHTML.slice(0,5000)');
```

